<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CENBANK CALLS FOR NATIONAL WAGE DEAL.</title>
<headline>CZECH CENBANK CALLS FOR NATIONAL WAGE DEAL.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank called on labour, government, and employers on Thursday to strike a nationwide agreement to slow down the growth of wages as a key element in the stabilisation of the economy.</p>
<p>In a statement the central bank said that if wage growth is not slowed, it would be forced to tighten monetary policy even further.</p>
</text>
